WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:01,910
Do you want to go to court?

2
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:02,950
I don't want to go

3
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:04,190
Why did I just bully her?

4
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:05,830
The old fairy family has a grievance against my family

5
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:07,710
Logically speaking, my family owes you

6
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:08,870
If you don't dislike it

7
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:10,190
Just come to my place

8
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:12,970
This is what you invited me to do

9
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:14,570
I thought I was going to get into a fight with Uuchou.

10
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:15,530
like a tv show

11
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:16,690
All kinds of magic weapons flying around

12
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:17,810
Didn't expect it to be so simple

13
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:18,930
Just say a few words

14
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:20,210
This is because of her own resentment

15
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:22,290
I almost came to you to vent my anger.

16
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:23,850
I just think it's unfair

17
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:26,050
If it is really contaminated with the cause and effect of life

18
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:27,410
It won't be that simple

19
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:29,960
I remember, senior brother, it’s getting late

20
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,120
You should also rest quickly

21
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:36,400
Good morning, senior brother, where is Lao Liu?

22
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,680
Uncle Liu has something else to do over there

23
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:38,900
Let's go first

24
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,020
Then he said you did a good job this time

25
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:44,060
Old Liu is not as reckless as before.

26
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,420
Is it difficult to praise me in person?

27
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,580
You and him look very much like father and son.

28
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,980
I'm much better looking than him

29
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,980
You are more narcissistic than him and I can't tell you.

30
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:53,060
But it feels very similar

31
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:54,340
I'm leaving after breakfast

32
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:56,260
I still have things to do

33
00:00:56,260 --> 00:00:57,340
My vacation is over

34
00:00:57,340 --> 00:01:00,140
I have to go back to work too. I’ll keep in touch with you on Sunday.
